るご質問</span></a></li><li><a href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/news"><span>お知らせ</span></a></li><li><a href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/about"><span>会社概要</span></a></li></ul></div><a class="crn-prt crn-prt_hd6 type_text hover_underline" style="margin-left:40px" href="https://www.hpdsp.net/seoto-0415/hw/hwp5300/hww5301init.do?yadNo=394705" target="_blank">予約確認・キャンセル</a><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_hd7 type_jln_language pattern_1 b__b1" style="margin-left:25px"><div class="lang-label">language<span class="svg-icon svg-icon--top svg-icon--nomargin c__t1"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><polygon points="20,5.9 19.011,5 10,13.2 0.989,5 0,5.9 10,15"></polygon></svg></span></div></div></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_hd8 type_block clearfix" style="padding-bottom:10px;min-height:45px"><a class="crn-prt crn-prt_hd9 type_block" style="float:left" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/"><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_hd11 type_image pattern_1"><img src="https://cdn.r-corona.jp/prd.jln.r-corona.jp/assets/site_files/lgqle05z/1190609/9385_bw1540h144.png" alt="秋川渓谷　瀬音の湯"/></div></a><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_hd12 type_block flex align-center" style="padding-top:5px;float:right"></div></div></div></div><div class="header-part"><div class="wrap header-contents"></div></div></header></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="contents-left bg__bg1"><div class="bg__bg1"><div><nav class="crn-prt crn-prt_hd3 type_nav pattern_4 bold" style="letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:42px"><ul><li><a href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/"><span>トップ</span></a></li><li><a href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/facility"><span>施設のご案内</span></a></li><li><a href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/page2"><span>温泉</span></a></li><li><a href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/restaurant"><span>お食事</span></a></li><li><a href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/room"><span>宿泊コテージ</span></a></li><li><a href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/page1"><span>物産販売所</span></a></li><li class="current"><a href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/access"><span>交通・アクセス</span></a></li></ul></nav><a class="crn-prt crn-prtbtn4a type_button pattern_1 mb_24 font_16" href="https://www.hpdsp.net/seoto-0415/hw/hwp3100/hww3101.do?yadNo=394705" target="_blank"><div class="btn--body">宿泊予約</div></a></div></div></div><div class="contents-right"><main class="b__b3" style="border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid"><div class="bg bg--08_c"><section class="section type_1"><div class="wrap"><div class="crn-cmp mb_16 mt_16"><div class="crn-prt crn-prtbc type_bread_crumb section-contents l__l1--inner hover_underline--inner section-contents"><ol itemType="http://schema.org/BreadcrumbList"><li itemscope="" itemProp="itemListElement" itemType="http://schema.org/ListItem"><a href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/" itemProp="item"><span itemProp="name">トップ</span></a></li><li itemscope="" itemProp="itemListElement" itemType="http://schema.org/ListItem"><span itemProp="name">交通・アクセス</span></li></ol></div></div><div class="crn-cmp"><div class="crn-prt crn-prthl1 type_headline section-contents mb_10 section-contents" style="line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0"><h1 class="crn-prt type_text c__t31 font_22 bold">交通・アクセス</h1></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prti1 type_image pattern_6 mb_32"><img src="https://cdn.r-corona.jp/prd.jln.r-corona.jp/assets/site_files/lgqle05z/1190357/n0it_jw1200h360.jpg"/></div></div></div></section><section class="section type_1"><div class="wrap section-contents"><div class="crn-cmp"><div class="crn-prt crn-prthl2 type_headline c__t11 mb_32 decor decor--ml" style="margin-top:32px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.1em;padding-left:20px"><h2 class="crn-prt type_text font_26 bold">心を癒す大自然と温泉の秋川渓谷</h2></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_a3 type_block"><div class="crn-prt crn-prtm1 type_map b__b3" style="border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-bottom:none"><iframe width="100%" height="100%" frameBorder="0" style="border:0" src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed/v1/place?key=AIzaSyBQIf4SrUd2KOjXbmuh06xdf_iK-0M9EFE&amp;language=ja&amp;region=JP&amp;zoom=17&amp;q=35.727211,139.187894" allowfullscreen=""></iframe></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_a4 type_box pattern_2 bg__bg5" style="position:relative"><div class="content"><a class="crn-prt crn-prt_a5 type_text lh__l1 hover_underline" style="position:absolute;top:10px;right:20px;line-height:20px" href="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=35.727211,139.187894&amp;z=16&amp;t=m&amp;hl=ja&amp;region=JP&amp;gl=US&amp;mapclient=embed" target="_blank"><span class="svg-icon svg-icon--tall c__t9 font_12"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 20"><path d="M6.7,0C3,0,0,2.7,0,5.9C0,9,6.7,20,6.7,20s6.7-11,6.7-14.1C13.3,2.7,10.3,0,6.7,0z M6.7,8.2c-1.4,0-2.5-1-2.5-2.2s1.1-2.2,2.5-2.2s2.5,1,2.5,2.2S8.1,8.2,6.7,8.2z"></path><ellipse fill="#FFFFFF" style="opacity:0" cx="9.998" cy="8.876" rx="3.794" ry="3.368"></ellipse></svg></span>Google Map</a><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_a4_1 type_block"><table class="crn-prt crn-prttbl3b type_table font_16"><tbody><tr><th><h3>宿名</h3></th><td>秋川渓谷 瀬音の湯（あきがわけいこく せおとのゆ）</td></tr><tr><th><h3>住所</h3></th><td>〒190-0174　東京都あきる野市乙津５６５</td></tr><tr><th><h3>電話番号</h3></th><td>042-595-2614</td></tr><tr><th><h3>備考</h3></th><td>JR五日市線終点「武蔵五日市駅」下車、西東京バスにて「瀬音の湯」下車すぐ目の前。<br/>送迎バスはありませんが、当館までの有料路線バスがあります。(西東京バス)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div><div class="crn-cmp"><div class="crn-prt crn-prthl2 type_headline c__t11 mb_32 decor decor--ml" style="margin-top:32px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.1em;padding-left:20px"><h2 class="crn-prt type_text font_26 bold">深緑の自然に囲まれた瀬音の湯</h2></div></div></div></section><section class="section type_1 bg__bg4 mb_32"><div class="wrap section-contents"><div class="crn-cmp mb_0 mt_0"><div class="crn-prt crn-prtal1 type_list pattern_11 mb_24 mt_24"><ul><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtal1_1 type_text mb_16 mt_16 bold lh__l1 hover_underline" style="line-height:26px;padding-left:42px;position:relative" href="#1341978"><span class="svg-icon svg-icon--middle c__t9 font_12" style="padding:0;margin-top:-0.3em"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 12"><polygon points="20,1.1 19,0 10,9.9 1,0 0,1.1 10,12"></polygon></svg></span>車をご利用の場合</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtal1_1 type_text mb_16 mt_16 bold lh__l1 hover_underline" style="line-height:26px;padding-left:42px;position:relative" href="#1634180"><span class="svg-icon svg-icon--middle c__t9 font_12" style="padding:0;margin-top:-0.3em"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 12"><polygon points="20,1.1 19,0 10,9.9 1,0 0,1.1 10,12"></polygon></svg></span>電車でお越しの場合</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtal1_1 type_text mb_16 mt_16 bold lh__l1 hover_underline" style="line-height:26px;padding-left:42px;position:relative" href="#1634181"><span class="svg-icon svg-icon--middle c__t9 font_12" style="padding:0;margin-top:-0.3em"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 12"><polygon points="20,1.1 19,0 10,9.9 1,0 0,1.1 10,12"></polygon></svg></span>タクシーでお越しの場合</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtal1_1 type_text mb_16 mt_16 bold lh__l1 hover_underline" style="line-height:26px;padding-left:42px;position:relative" href="#1634183"><span class="svg-icon svg-icon--middle c__t9 font_12" style="padding:0;margin-top:-0.3em"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 12"><polygon points="20,1.1 19,0 10,9.9 1,0 0,1.1 10,12"></polygon></svg></span>バスでお越しの場合</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtal1_1 type_text mb_16 mt_16 bold lh__l1 hover_underline" style="line-height:26px;padding-left:42px;position:relative" href="#1634184"><span class="svg-icon svg-icon--middle c__t9 font_12" style="padding:0;margin-top:-0.3em"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 12"><polygon points="20,1.1 19,0 10,9.9 1,0 0,1.1 10,12"></polygon></svg></span>檜原村方面バス乗車の方(瀬音の湯を通過するバス)</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtal1_1 type_text mb_16 mt_16 bold lh__l1 hover_underline" style="line-height:26px;padding-left:42px;position:relative" href="#1634242"><span class="svg-icon svg-icon--middle c__t9 font_12" style="padding:0;margin-top:-0.3em"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 12"><polygon points="20,1.1 19,0 10,9.9 1,0 0,1.1 10,12"></polygon></svg></span>秋川渓谷 瀬音の湯 周辺地図</a></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="section type_1"><div class="wrap section-contents"><div class="crn-cmp"><div class="crn-prt crn-prtls1 type_list"><ul><li><div id="1341978" class="crn-prt crn-prt_a2 type_block clearfix"><h3 class="crn-prt crn-prthl4b type_headline mb_24 l__l1--inner hover_underline--inner" style="line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.1em"><div class="crn-prt type_text c__t11 font_22 bold">車をご利用の場合</div></h3><div class="crn-prt crn-prti3 type_image pattern_1 mb_24 align_center"><img src="https://cdn.r-corona.jp/prd.jln.r-corona.jp/assets/site_files/lgqle05z/1190862/fx62_bw1200.png"/></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prtt1d type_text mb_32 font_16">【新宿方面より】<br/>新宿から中央自動車道に入り八王子ICで降り滝山街道方面へ～圏央道あきる野IC～国道411号より五日市街道、桧原街道33号線上に看板あり。<br/>※圏央道あきる野ICを降りてから瀬音の湯まで約30分<br/><br/>【駐車場】<br/>無料駐車場あり / 135台利用可能<br/>※障がい者専用スペース3台 / 二輪車駐輪場あり<br/>・宿泊者の方は、混雑時でも宿泊者専用駐車場がありますので、そのまま駐車出来ます。<br/>・温泉棟側のスペースは、宿泊者専用となっております。<br/>・駐車場内での事故・盗難については責任を負いかねます。<br/>・以下の場所は駐車禁止です。<br/>　①バス停付近<br/>　②駐車場内の道路<br/>　③駐車場以外のスペース<br/>　④その他歩行者や他の車両の通行の妨げになる場所<br/>・バスなど、小型・中型・大型車両の駐車場はありません。<br/>・バイクや自転車等の二輪車は駐輪場への駐輪をお願いします。<br/>※当館でのお預かりは固くお断りしています。</div><div class="crn-prt crn-prtlnk_list2 type_list" style="float:right"><ul><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtlnk1 type_text pattern_1 lh__l1 hover_underline" style="padding-left:20px;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;line-height:1.5" href="https://goo.gl/maps/HNLeK" target="_blank"><span class="svg-icon svg-icon--small-tall svg-icon--abs_top c__t9 font_14" style="margin-top:0.3em"><svg viewBox="0 0 10.8 20"><polygon points="1,0 0,1 8.8,10 0,19 1,20 10.8,10"></polygon></svg></span>Google Map</a></li></ul></div></div></li><li><div id="1634180" class="crn-prt crn-prt_a2 type_block clearfix"><h3 class="crn-prt crn-prthl4b type_headline mb_24 l__l1--inner hover_underline--inner" style="line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.1em"><div class="crn-prt type_text c__t11 font_22 bold">電車でお越しの場合</div></h3><div class="crn-prt crn-prti3 type_image pattern_1 mb_24 align_center"><img src="https://cdn.r-corona.jp/prd.jln.r-corona.jp/assets/site_files/lgqle05z/1193331/s4dx_bw1200.gif"/></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prtt1d type_text mb_32 font_16">【最寄駅】<br/>JR武蔵五日市駅<br/>拝島駅からJR五日市線に乗車(約22分)</div></div></li><li><div id="1634181" class="crn-prt crn-prt_a2 type_block clearfix"><h3 class="crn-prt crn-prthl4b type_headline mb_24 l__l1--inner hover_underline--inner" style="line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.1em"><div class="crn-prt type_text c__t11 font_22 bold">タクシーでお越しの場合</div></h3><div class="crn-prt crn-prtt1d type_text mb_32 font_16">武蔵五日市駅から片道2,500円程度<br/>【タクシー会社】<br/>・横川交通：TEL 0120-489-083(フリーダイヤル)<br/>・京王タクシー：TEL 0428-22-2612</div></div></li><li><div id="1634183" class="crn-prt crn-prt_a2 type_block clearfix"><h3 class="crn-prt crn-prthl4b type_headline mb_24 l__l1--inner hover_underline--inner" style="line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.1em"><div class="crn-prt type_text c__t11 font_22 bold">バスでお越しの場合</div></h3><div class="crn-prt crn-prti3 type_image pattern_1 mb_24 align_center"><img src="https://cdn.r-corona.jp/prd.jln.r-corona.jp/assets/site_files/lgqle05z/1193332/ys3k_bw1200.gif"/></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prtt1d type_text mb_32 font_16">駅前バスターミナル(1)番のりば「瀬音の湯経由上養沢行き」乗車(約17分)<br/><br/>※バス時刻については場合により変更される事もございます。<br/>随時、西東京バスにご確認をお願いします。<br/>※上記の他「十里木バス停」で途中下車(瀬音の湯まで約10分)などのご来場方法もあります。<br/>詳しくは、「西東京バス五日市営業所」までお問い合わせ下さい。<br/>【バスに関するお問い合わせ】<br/>西東京バス五日市営業所：TEL 042-596-1611</div></div></li><li><div id="1634184" class="crn-prt crn-prt_a2 type_block clearfix"><h3 class="crn-prt crn-prthl4b type_headline mb_24 l__l1--inner hover_underline--inner" style="line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.1em"><div class="crn-prt type_text c__t11 font_22 bold">檜原村方面バス乗車の方(瀬音の湯を通過するバス)</div></h3><div class="crn-prt crn-prti3 type_image pattern_1 mb_24 align_center"><img src="https://cdn.r-corona.jp/prd.jln.r-corona.jp/assets/site_files/lgqle05z/1193333/bpkw_bw1200.gif"/></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prtt1d type_text mb_32 font_16">駅前バスターミナル(1)番のりばより「払沢の滝入口・藤倉・数馬」行き、<br/>または、「上養沢」行きに乗車し、「十里木(じゅうりぎ)」バス停下車。<br/>下車後、道路を横断し檜原村方面に進みます。<br/>秋川に掛かる「石舟橋(いしぶねばし)」を渡り、林の中の散策路を進みます。<br/>途中2手に分かれていますがどちらでも結構です。<br/>林を抜けると瀬音の湯に到着です。(約8分)<br/>【バスに関するお問い合わせ】<br/>西東京バス五日市営業所：TEL 042-596-1611</div></div></li><li><div id="1634242" class="crn-prt crn-prt_a2 type_block clearfix"><h3 class="crn-prt crn-prthl4b type_headline mb_24 l__l1--inner hover_underline--inner" style="line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0.1em"><div class="crn-prt type_text c__t11 font_22 bold">秋川渓谷 瀬音の湯 周辺地図</div></h3><div class="crn-prt crn-prti3 type_image pattern_1 mb_24 align_center"><img src="https://cdn.r-corona.jp/prd.jln.r-corona.jp/assets/site_files/lgqle05z/1190938/n8r7_bw1200.png"/></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prtt1d type_text mb_32 font_16">秋川渓谷 瀬音の湯周辺の地図をご覧頂けます。</div><div class="crn-prt crn-prtlnk_list2 type_list" style="float:right"><ul><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtlnk1 type_text pattern_1 lh__l1 hover_underline" style="padding-left:20px;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;line-height:1.5" href="https://cdn.r-corona.jp/prd.jln.r-corona.jp/assets/site_files/lgqle05z/1190938/n8r7.png" target="_blank"><span class="svg-icon svg-icon--small-tall svg-icon--abs_top c__t9 font_14" style="margin-top:0.3em"><svg viewBox="0 0 10.8 20"><polygon points="1,0 0,1 8.8,10 0,19 1,20 10.8,10"></polygon></svg></span>秋川渓谷 瀬音の湯 周辺地図①</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtlnk1 type_text pattern_1 lh__l1 hover_underline" style="padding-left:20px;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;line-height:1.5" href="https://cdn.r-corona.jp/prd.jln.r-corona.jp/assets/site_files/lgqle05z/1190939/k2dv.png" target="_blank"><span class="svg-icon svg-icon--small-tall svg-icon--abs_top c__t9 font_14" style="margin-top:0.3em"><svg viewBox="0 0 10.8 20"><polygon points="1,0 0,1 8.8,10 0,19 1,20 10.8,10"></polygon></svg></span>秋川渓谷 瀬音の湯 周辺地図②</a></li></ul></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section></div></main><footer class="c__t8 bg__bg8 bg bg--08_b"><div class="wrap"><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft1 type_block pattern_2 centered" style="width:700px;margin-bottom:50px"><div class="crn-prt crn-prtls3 type_list" style="width:175px;vertical-align:top"><ul><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtt7 type_text pattern_11 b__b1 align_center hover_underline" style="word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/">トップ</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtt7 type_text pattern_11 b__b1 align_center hover_underline" style="word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/facility">施設のご案内</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtt7 type_text pattern_11 b__b1 align_center hover_underline" style="word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/page2">温泉</a></li></ul></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prtls3 type_list" style="width:175px;vertical-align:top"><ul><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtt7 type_text pattern_11 b__b1 align_center hover_underline" style="word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/restaurant">お食事</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtt7 type_text pattern_11 b__b1 align_center hover_underline" style="word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/room">宿泊コテージ</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtt7 type_text pattern_11 b__b1 align_center hover_underline" style="word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/page1">物産販売所</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtt7 type_text pattern_11 b__b1 align_center hover_underline" style="word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/access">交通・アクセス</a></li></ul></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prtls3 type_list" style="width:175px;vertical-align:top"><ul><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtt7 type_text pattern_11 b__b1 align_center hover_underline" style="word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/gallery">フォトギャラリー</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtt7 type_text pattern_11 b__b1 align_center hover_underline" style="word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/faq">よくあるご質問</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtt7 type_text pattern_11 b__b1 align_center hover_underline" style="word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/news">お知らせ</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtt7 type_text pattern_11 b__b1 align_center hover_underline" style="word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/about">会社概要</a></li></ul></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prtls4 type_list" style="width:175px;vertical-align:top"><ul><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtt8 type_text align_center hover_underline" style="word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/agreement/privacy">プライバシーポリシー</a></li><li><a class="crn-prt crn-prtt8 type_text align_center hover_underline" style="word-wrap:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/agreement/lodging">宿泊約款</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft2 type_block mb_32"><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft3 type_block"><a class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft3_1 type_text font_28" style="display:inline;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0" href="http://www.seotonoyu.jp/">秋川渓谷 瀬音の湯</a></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft4 type_block"><span class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft12 type_text">〒</span><span class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft11 type_text">190-0174</span><span class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft12 type_text">東京都あきる野市乙津５６５</span></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft5 type_block"><span class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft11 type_text">TEL</span><span class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft12 type_text">042-595-2614</span></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft6 type_block"><span class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft11 type_text">FAX</span><span class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft12 type_text">042-595-3121</span></div></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft9 type_block pattern_2" style="overflow:hidden"><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft8 type_block pattern_2" style="float:right;font-size:32px;line-height:1"><a class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft21 type_icon" href="https://www.facebook.com/people/Akigawakeikoku-Seotonoyu/61562632275931/" target="_blank"><img src="https://cdn.r-corona.jp/prd.jln.r-corona.jp/assets/theme_img/facebook-6d2f4259ea918a85f2858b819d4fdd839ebd123b83a6cb2d4841c153958d43e4.svg" alt="Facebook" width="32" height="32"/></a><a class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft23 type_icon" style="margin-left:16px" href="https://www.instagram.com/a_seotonoyu?igsh=anVtY3hqd2VlbDky" target="_blank"><img src="https://cdn.r-corona.jp/prd.jln.r-corona.jp/assets/theme_img/instagram-3814c03de5e17d78ea6c9eb7e15965aaded97c2bf5bbccba675f73882c725e43.svg" alt="Instagram" width="32" height="32"/></a><a class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft24 type_icon" style="margin-left:16px" href="https://www.jalan.net/yad394705/" target="_blank"><img src="https://cdn.r-corona.jp/prd.jln.r-corona.jp/assets/theme_img/jalannet-de890ab9a9b07a00850d5ba05bd41d44a7b22627d4e24ced8feeceebaa90947d.svg" alt="じゃらんnet" width="32" height="32"/></a></div><span class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft7 type_text font_12" style="line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0">Copyright（C）2025 秋川渓谷 瀬音の湯 All Reserved.</span></div><div class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft29 type_block pattern_2"><a class="crn-prt crn-prt_ft28 type_text font_12 hover_underline" style="vertical-align:middle;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0" href="https://www.hpdsp.net/hpdsp/doc/cookie_hpdsp.html" target="_blank">cookieの利用について</a></div><div id="tripai-cntrl-toplink" class="crn-prt crn-prtpt1 tripai-cntrl-hidden type_page_top"></div></div></footer></div></div></div></div>
